<title>USA: Clinton to unveil pension initiative on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Clinton to unveil pension initiative on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton on Tuesday plans to unveil ways to &quot;enhance pension protections for workers who change jobs,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry said on Monday.</p>
<p>McCurry told reporters Clinton was expected to make the announcement at around 9:15 a.m. EDT (1315 GMT) at the White House before leaving on a four-day campaign trip to the Midwest and the West Coast.</p>
<p>The spokesman gave no further details.</p>
</text>
